Hollowmere
Copyright (c) 2026 PowerBeef. All rights reserved.

This directory holds the game Hollowmere: its source code (game/src), its
content and the generators that produce it (game/content: levels, story and
text, models, textures, sprites, sounds, music, characters), its pre-rendered
assets (game/assets) and test data (game/tests). The screenshots in
docs/media/ are also part of the game.

None of it is licensed for reuse. You may download this repository, build the
game from it and play it for your own use. You may not redistribute the game,
its ROM or any part of its content, or use its content (in whole or in part)
in other works, without written permission from the copyright holder.

The Hollowmere Engine (everything outside game/ and docs/media/) is open
source under the MIT License; see the LICENSE file at the root of the
repository. Build your own games with it, with your own content.
